    not_duplicate_of: []  # 6074
    pr_ref:  # 6074
    description: "Repro (dev 77cca016e9): enum Color { RED, GREEN; String label() { return helper() }; String helper() {...} } plus class Other { String helper() {...} } -> label and helper emitted as kind function with no Color. qualifier, and calls label -> Other.helper. Consequence: enum methods look like free functions, and their calls land on an unrelated class, so Color.helper looks dead and Other.helper gains a false caller. Likely cause: _get_enclosing_class omits enum_declaration. Analogue of WI-fonaz (PHP) and the C# record item."  # 6074
    fields: {}  # 6074
